[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3369173231","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111290#issuecomment-3369173231","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111290","id":3369173231,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7I0YDv","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-05T16:40:31Z","updated_at":"2025-10-05T16:40:31Z","body":"> The error will still print once but that's kinda expected. If two separate Godot instances try to start the language server on the same port there exists a conflict.\r\n\r\nThe error is pretty generic so I think we should still aim to address that. Users will think it's a bug.\r\n\r\nInstead of a networking error, we should either say nothing (most users don't use the LSP so don't care if it's not available on a second instance) or print a warning that's explicit about the issue.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3369173231/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3369184526","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111290#issuecomment-3369184526","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111290","id":3369184526,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7I0a0O","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-05T17:00:04Z","updated_at":"2025-10-05T17:00:04Z","body":"> The error is pretty generic so I think we should still aim to address that. Users will think it's a bug.\r\n\r\nThis PR is needed regardless of that.\r\n\r\nIt might be something worth looking into. However, if some component below it all of a sudden fails with error message instead of failing silently that's nothing the language server can influence.\r\n\r\nIn general the codebase lacks proper rules for usage of `ERR_FAIL` macros in methods that return `Error`. There is no way to force a method to fail silently (except maybe relying on `ERR_PRINT_OFF` but that's really not a pattern I would want to introduce to the language server).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3369184526/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3369331668","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111290#issuecomment-3369331668","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111290","id":3369331668,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7I0-vU","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-05T21:08:59Z","updated_at":"2025-10-05T21:09:11Z","body":"> > The error is pretty generic so I think we should still aim to address that. Users will think it's a bug.\r\n> \r\n> This PR is needed regardless of that.\r\n> \r\n> It might be something worth looking into. However, if some component below it all of a sudden fails with error message instead of failing silently that's nothing the language server can influence.\r\n\r\nThis is addressed by #111300.\r\n\r\n> In general the codebase lacks proper rules for usage of `ERR_FAIL` macros in methods that return `Error`. There is no way to force a method to fail silently (except maybe relying on `ERR_PRINT_OFF` but that's really not a pattern I would want to introduce to the language server).\r\n\r\nYeah that's a problem in general, we need to rely less on `ERR_FAIL` and do a better job at bubbling up and handling error codes in the original call site.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3369331668/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3371381257","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111290#issuecomment-3371381257","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111290","id":3371381257,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7I8zIJ","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https:/